{"id":"303544f188","t":"Shishunki Renaissance! David-kun","c":"","n":35,"l":35,"s":["aq"],"k":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun"},"u":1795036073049,"desc":"لربما لديه شبه من عمل فني مشهور عالميًا، لكن ديفيد ليس سوى طالب ثانوية يرتاد مدرسة لوفر الثانوية. هذا الفتى غير الاجتماعي، والذي أربكه سن المراهقة، واقع بغرام زميلته فينوس. أي نوع من المتاعب يخفيها طريق الحب الوعر…؟! حتى مايكل أنجلو سيدهش! كوميديا فاحشة تتملك الحياة اليومية لمراهق!","type":"مانجا","status":"مستمرة","genres":["3asq","شريحة من الحياة","شونين","كوميديا","مدرسة"],"src":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun"},"chapters":{"1":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/01/"},"2":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/02/"},"3":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/03/"},"4":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/04/"},"5":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/05/"},"6":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/06/"},"7":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/07/"},"8":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/08/"},"9":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/09/"},"10":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/10/"},"11":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/11/"},"12":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/12/"},"13":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/13/"},"14":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/14/"},"15":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-david-kun/15/"},"16":{"aq":"shishunki-renaissance-david-kun|/manga/shishunki-renaissance-da